---
/**
 * Masalah: 2 kolom. Kiri copy + foto; kanan "bon" upload manual (ledger).
 * Foto: Unsplash yang diverifikasi 200; diberi duotone hangat agar masuk Safelight palette.
 */
const PROBLEM_IMG =
  'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1554048612-b6a482bc67e5?q=80&w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop'
---

<section class="border-y border-border/60 bg-sunken">
  <div class="container-site grid gap-12 py-20 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-16 lg:py-28">
    <div>
      <p class="kicker">Masalahnya</p>
      <h2 class="section-headline mt-4 text-balance">
        Malam setelah event seharusnya milik Anda, bukan milik laptop.
      </h2>
      <p class="body-copy mt-5">
        Seribu foto berarti seribu kali pilih file, tunggu upload satu-satu, dan berharap koneksi
        tidak putus. Begitu gagal, antrean ulang dari awal. Sementara klien sudah bertanya:
        “Fotonya sudah bisa dilihat?”
      </p>

      <figure class="mt-8">
        <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-[10px] border border-border">
          <img
            src={PROBLEM_IMG}
            alt="Seorang fotografer event sedang bekerja"
            width="1200"
            height="800"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
            class="aspect-[3/2] w-full object-cover"
            style="filter: sepia(0.35) saturate(0.85) brightness(0.82) contrast(1.05)"
          />
        </div>
      </figure>
    </div>

    <div class="lg:pt-16">
      <div class="rounded-[10px] border border-border bg-surface p-6 sm:p-7">
        <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3">
          <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold">Bon upload manual</h3>
          <p class="font-mono text-xs text-muted-foreground">1 event · 1.000 foto</p>
        </div>
        <dl class="mt-5 space-y-3 font-mono text-[13px]">
          <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4">
            <dt class="text-muted-foreground">Pilih foto satu-satu</dt>
            <dd class="shrink-0 text-foreground">± 4 jam</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4">
            <dt class="text-muted-foreground">Isi harga &amp; lokasi per batch</dt>
            <dd class="shrink-0 text-foreground">± 30 mnt</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4">
            <dt class="text-muted-foreground">Koneksi putus, antrean ulang</dt>
            <dd class="shrink-0 text-foreground">± 2 jam</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4">
            <dt class="text-muted-foreground">Menunggui laptop</dt>
            <dd class="shrink-0 text-foreground">semalaman</dd>
          </div>
        </dl>
        <div class="mt-5 flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 border-t border-border pt-4 font-mono text-[13px]">
          <p class="text-muted-foreground">Foto tayang</p>
          <p class="font-medium text-foreground">besok siang</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="body-copy mt-6 text-[15px]">
        Dengan Foto Space, bon di atas menjadi tiga langkah: pilih folder, pilih event, klik
        upload. Foto tayang malam itu juga.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
